  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Commonwealth Virtual Centre for Small States</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As a 2022 CHOGM mandate, The Commonwealth Virtual Centre for Small States (VCSS) is intended to connect the Commonwealth Small States with the Secretariat and other accredited and partner organisations by means of a virtual platform for small states. The VCSS is meant to facilitate information and knowledge exchange as well as to access technical trainings based on toolkits developed by the Secretariat. In the medium term to encourage more joint collaboration of activities among the Commonwealth member Small States.</narrative>
  </description>
